		COLOR MAP PINOUT		(LEBEL KLUDGE)

Note, the card goes in the backplane UPSIDE-DOWN.  I.e. the
legend "Artificial Intelligence" is to be upside-down, and the
components are on the solder side, not the component side.

A1 - nc			A2 - +5
B1 - -BLANK		B2 - CLK^ (clocks addr into ram, data out)
C1 - nc			C2 - GND
D1 - nc			D2 - ADDR0
E1 - nc			E2 - ADDR1
F1 - nc			F2 - ADDR2
H1 - nc			H2 - ADDR3
J1 - nc			J2 - ADDR4
K1 - nc			K2 - ADDR5
L1 - nc			L2 - WDATA8
M1 - nc			M2 - WDATA7
N1 - nc			N2 - WDATA6
P1 - nc			P2 - WDATA5
R1 - -WRITE MEM		R2 - WDATA4
S1 - nc			S2 - WDATA3
T1 - GND		T2 - WDATA2
U1 - -15 V		U2 - WDATA1
V1 - +15 V		V2 - WDATA0
